00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:34.467
(upbeat guitar music)

00:00:37.132 --> 00:00:39.346
- So a minute. That's, that's not bad.

00:00:39.346 --> 00:00:40.801
Alright, you're going down.

00:00:40.801 --> 00:00:42.861
- If I can do it, I'm
going to have Marty join.

00:00:42.861 --> 00:00:44.588
I know, what?

00:00:44.588 --> 00:00:45.746
(slam, slam)

00:00:45.746 --> 00:00:47.663
(beep)

00:00:48.785 --> 00:00:51.251
(carnival piano music)

00:00:51.251 --> 00:00:52.207
- Ugh, I hate this.

00:00:52.207 --> 00:00:54.434
- Aahh...
- Mmm, wasn't bad.

00:00:54.434 --> 00:00:56.371
(laughter)
- Oh my god.

00:00:56.371 --> 00:00:59.005
- It's all over my nose!
- Can you still bend down?

00:00:59.005 --> 00:00:59.838
- Marty's jealous.

00:00:59.838 --> 00:01:02.088
(laughter)

00:01:06.604 --> 00:01:08.206
- [Kane] I can't do it.

00:01:08.206 --> 00:01:09.539
I can't, oh god.

00:01:10.675 --> 00:01:12.240
- It's all over my nose.

00:01:12.240 --> 00:01:15.683
- (laughter) Oh my god, what are we doing?

00:01:15.683 --> 00:01:17.572
- Peanut butter. Go.

00:01:17.572 --> 00:01:19.822
(laughter)

00:01:21.573 --> 00:01:25.740
- It seriously tastes amazing,
though. You have to say it.

00:01:27.913 --> 00:01:29.812
- Ugh. This is so stupid.

00:01:29.812 --> 00:01:31.205
- [Off Screen] One minute.

00:01:31.205 --> 00:01:32.705
- Oh my god.
- Eww.

00:01:33.640 --> 00:01:34.890
- I feel dirty.

00:01:42.630 --> 00:01:45.009
(dinging bell)

00:01:45.009 --> 00:01:46.342
- Marty, we won!

00:01:48.231 --> 00:01:50.353
(dinging bell)

00:01:50.353 --> 00:01:51.770
- Yeah, good job!

00:01:55.128 --> 00:01:57.231
- What? Oh (bleep)!

00:01:57.231 --> 00:01:58.299
- You're going down, Kane!

00:01:58.299 --> 00:01:59.711
(slam, slam)

00:01:59.711 --> 00:02:01.459
(beep)

00:02:01.459 --> 00:02:02.831
- [Maycie] Oh, God. I
gotta win this again.

00:02:02.831 --> 00:02:05.081
(laughter)

00:02:07.200 --> 00:02:10.033
(classical music)

00:02:15.599 --> 00:02:18.671
- Oh my god, it's so much better.

00:02:18.671 --> 00:02:21.383
- Yeah, you have to swallow it, right?

00:02:21.383 --> 00:02:24.883
- I'm doing way better than the last time.

00:02:36.025 --> 00:02:39.169
- I definitely went
deeper than the last time.

00:02:39.169 --> 00:02:41.506
I feel like I did way better.

00:02:41.506 --> 00:02:43.251
- I mean, I was just really going for it.

00:02:43.251 --> 00:02:45.944
I don't know why, but I kind
of went with like a diagonal.

00:02:45.944 --> 00:02:48.094
- Wow!
- Did I do good?

00:02:48.094 --> 00:02:49.998
- I'm very impressed with Maycie's work.

00:02:49.998 --> 00:02:50.831
(laughter)

00:02:50.831 --> 00:02:52.301
- I (bleep) love peanut butter.

00:02:52.301 --> 00:02:55.360
- Maycie probably likes peanut
butter more than Marty does.

00:02:55.360 --> 00:02:57.179
- [Kane] Yay!
- [Maycie] Yes!

00:02:57.179 --> 00:02:58.173
(laughter)

00:02:58.173 --> 00:03:00.381
- [Kane] Congrats. High five.

00:03:00.381 --> 00:03:01.565
- So can I call myself, like,

00:03:01.565 --> 00:03:04.221
Buzzfeed's biggest
peanut butter lover now?

00:03:04.221 --> 00:03:06.272
Oh my god, you weren't kidding!

00:03:06.272 --> 00:03:08.022
Oh my god, thank you.

00:03:09.320 --> 00:03:10.589
It's beautiful.

00:03:10.589 --> 00:03:12.506
I'll share it with you.

00:03:14.255 --> 00:03:16.817
- Okay, yeah please. Please,
I can't have any for a while.

00:03:16.817 --> 00:03:18.597
